  "description": "After Meil von Biseart has an ominous dream that Princess Riella destroys her home upon being rejected by the emperor of the Helberne Empire, she runs after Riella to stop her from joining the selection for the next empress. In the midst of her efforts, she meets a mysterious masked man in the palace garden who seems to know an awful lot about the emperor. As she uses this new intel for her plan, Meil begins to draw some unexpected attention... At this rate, her dream might come true! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
